# Episode 3 opening "The Gravedigger's Son", 91 s (docs/design/episode3-4-opening.md 3.1 + 5.1; task E34-B).
# Malrik tells his own life over the morning of the Battle of Evenmead: 15 lines, voice-over (the hidden `narrator`
# cast speaks as malrik: no name on the subtitles; voice = data/voice/manifest.json, bm_george). The same text lives in
# data/voice/lines/ep3_opening.json (from the design doc); L14 uses typographic quotes here (the .cine reader has no
# escapes), its WAV is rendered from this file.
# Sets: forge_evenmead (the valley, E34-A: marks B01 N05 N12 B14; the close shots are `cam=dolly` solved from the Lens words of 4.1
# on the set puppets (forge_ep3_memories/tools/evenmead_cams.gd; cine check frames every lens shot on ALL set puppets) until the Lens marks N02 N07 N10 N11 N13 are merged), forge_ep3_memories (the
# flashbacks G03 G04 G06 G09, memory grade in its light preset), forge_watch_keep (W02, reused as built).
# Memories cut in on fade_white:0.4 and out on blend:0.3. Music / sfx: assets/audio/forge/ (E34-B cues).
# Axis: the Malrik - Ysolde line runs north-south; every Ep3 camera stays EAST of it (Ep4 = the west side). Memory
# shots: the camera stays on the open side of each corner (fades reset the axis).
cine ep3_opening  title="Episode 3: The Gravedigger's Son"  letterbox=2.39  seed=34  length=88..94
use set forge_evenmead
use music res://assets/audio/forge/music/ep3_opening.wav  vol=-15
env dusk  moon_yaw=210  moon_pitch=-18  energy=0.8
# Malrik narrates (voice-over: hidden, no name on the subtitles)
cast  narrator  capsule  at=(0, 0, -300)  hidden=1  speaker=malrik
# W02 is a memory too: forge_watch_keep has no memory grade, so a full-screen grade (desaturate, violet lift, vignette)
# rides in that set (props/memory_grade.tscn, forge_ep3_memories/tools/ep3_extras.gd)
prop  w02_grade  res://art/cinematics/stage_sets/forge_ep3_memories/props/memory_grade.tscn  at=(0, 0, 0)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the morning of the battle
# Golden crane over Evenmead: the river, the ford, both hills, birds and pollen in the low sun
shot B01 8.0  in=fade_black:1.0
  at 0.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/evenmead_amb.wav  vol=-6
  at 3.0  line malrik "Everyone tells my story wrong. Let me try."  dur=3.4
# Malrik on his ridge, the valley below him
# Lens: "ms on malrik, 3/4-back-left, high, push 0.2" (solved on the set puppets by tools/evenmead_cams.gd)
shot N02 6.0  cam=dolly  from=(2.0, 10.0, -40.0)  to=(1.75, 9.95, -39.4)  look=(-3.85, 9.83, -20.87)>(-3.9, 9.8, -20.9)  fov=28>27  faces=malrik
  at 0.3  line malrik "I was a gravedigger's son. I grew up among the dead. They were better company."  dur=5.2

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- memory: the graveyard, one candle
# The boy reads a tombstone by one candle; his father's spade in the open grave; the Master stands among the stones
shot G03 6.0  set=forge_ep3_memories  in=fade_white:0.4
  at 0.2  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/shovel_earth.wav  vol=-8
  at 0.4  line malrik "The Master found me reading tombstones by one candle. He said: this one, too."  dur=5.2
  at 3.4  face m_boy  yaw=160  time=1.2
# The orrery: four flames, three apprentices lit by theirs, the Master between them; the boy alone by the violet one
shot G04 6.0  set=forge_ep3_memories
  at 0.3  line malrik "Too. Fourth of four. Fire was his joy, ice his patience, the wood his heart."  dur=5.2

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- back on the ridge
# The Shadow ranks lower their visors
shot N05 6.0  in=blend:0.3
  at 0.3  line malrik "And me? He gave me what was left over. The dark. As if it were a kindness."  dur=5.0
  at 1.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/army_armour.wav  vol=-6

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- memory: he is gone
# The same room: the Master's robe falls empty in a burst of his four colours, then the flames go out one by one
shot G06 6.0  set=forge_ep3_memories  in=fade_white:0.4
  at 0.3  line malrik "Then he vanished and left us nothing. So I took. That is the whole secret."  dur=5.0
  at 0.9  vfx gone scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/regalia_burst.tscn at=(0, 2.6, -1.3) life=1.6 scale=0.35
  at 1.0  hide m_sage
  at 1.9  hide flame_r
  at 1.9  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/candle_pinch.wav  vol=-8
  at 2.7  hide flame_b
  at 2.7  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/candle_pinch.wav  vol=-9
  at 3.5  hide flame_g
  at 3.5  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/candle_pinch.wav  vol=-8
  at 4.6  hide flame_v
  at 4.6  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/candle_pinch.wav  vol=-6

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- what he took
# Mother Hush draws her knives behind him
# Lens: "mcu on malrik, 3/4-left, low"
shot N07 6.5  in=blend:0.3  faces=malrik,hush
  at 0.0  teleport hush  to=(0.95, 7.434, -38.0)  yaw=-8
  at 0.3  line malrik "I took the dark and taught it to kneel. I took knives, and a woman who never misses."  dur=5.6
  at 2.0  anim hush play_attack
# Emberfall at nightfall: Vessa alive at her gate ("She missed")
shot W02 6.0  set=forge_watch_keep  in=fade_white:0.4
  at 0.3  line malrik "She missed. Emberfall. Then the Hollow. I lost, and lost, and every time I lost,"  dur=5.3
  at 0.4  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/knife_ring.wav  vol=-8
# The Hollow: on a flat stone the three things he kept, a burned-down candle, a knife and the heart-stone, beating
# Crane: low on the three relics (burned candle, knife, the beating stone), then up and back to reveal Malrik over them
shot G09 6.0  set=forge_ep3_memories  cam=dolly  from=(33.6, 0.55, 0.9)  to=(32.6, 1.05, 2.5)  look=(34.0, 0.42, -0.2)>(34.3, 1.45, -1.0)  fov=40>44  ease=in_out
  at 0.3  line malrik "I kept something. A candle. A knife. A stone that still beats in my hand."  dur=5.0
  at 0.5  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/stone_thump.wav  vol=-6
  at 1.65  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/stone_thump.wav  vol=-7
  at 2.2  anim m_malrik play_cast  arg=soul_siphon
  at 2.8  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/stone_thump.wav  vol=-6
  at 3.95  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/stone_thump.wav  vol=-7
  at 0.5  vfx heart_stone_pulse  scene=res://art/cinematics/stage_sets/forge_ep3_memories/props/heart_pulse.tscn  at=(34.02, 0.49, -0.04)  life=4.6

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the stone
# The heart-stone in his hand, pulsing amber
# Lens: "ecu on stone, front, high"
shot N10 6.0  cam=dolly  from=(0.9, 8.5, -33.7)  to=(0.6, 8.58, -34.1)  look=(-0.52, 9.35, -36.2)>(-0.5, 9.3, -36.15)  fov=32>29  ease=in_out  in=blend:0.3  faces=stone
  at 0.2  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/obren_whisper.wav  vol=-8
  at 1.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/stone_thump.wav  vol=-10
  at 2.15  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/stone_thump.wav  vol=-11
  at 3.3  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/stone_thump.wav  vol=-10
  at 4.45  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/stone_thump.wav  vol=-11
  at 1.0  vfx heart_stone_pulse  scene=res://art/cinematics/stage_sets/forge_ep3_memories/props/heart_pulse.tscn  at=(-0.42, 8.84, -35.38)  life=4.9  scale=0.7
  at 0.5  line malrik "It whispers. Let it. I am the one who listens, and I am the one who decides."  dur=5.2
# Torvald glances at the stone, then away
# Lens: "ms two-shot malrik torvald, 3/4-left, eye"
shot N11 6.0  faces=malrik,torvald
  at 0.3  line malrik "That is how a gravedigger's son grows strong: he never puts the shovel down."  dur=5.2
  at 3.0  face torvald  to=malrik  time=0.6
  at 4.6  face torvald  yaw=8  time=0.8
# Long lens across the valley: Lark Hill, the Master's golden tree, the other army
shot N12 10.0
  at 0.3  line malrik "Look at it. The last green country. Flowers to the knee. The Master's garden."  dur=5.1
  at 5.45  line malrik "They will stand there and tell me to stop. Fire. Roots. An old man's storm."  dur=4.9
# Close on him
# Lens: "cu on malrik, front, eye, push 0.3"
shot N13 5.5  faces=malrik
  at 0.4  line malrik "I have heard “stop” all my life."  dur=2.6
  at 3.3  line malrik "I will not stop."  dur=2.0
  at 3.2  anim malrik play_cast  arg=umbral_shroud
# Horns: both armies step off; the title
shot B14 7.0
  at 0.5  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/evenmead_horns.wav  vol=0
  at 3.0  title "Episode 3" sub="The Gravedigger's Son" time=3.5
  at 6.2  fade alpha=1 time=0.8
